{"reviewId": "900802853_860DWZMKa", "review": {"abstract": "2 500多年前，释迦牟尼用“色即是空”解释他对这个世界的表象与本原之间关系的看法，现在，这个世界的规则依然没有改变，一切表象皆会回归本原。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterUid": 8, "content": "“色即是空”不仅是佛教破执智慧，更揭示了宇宙运行的普遍法则：​​现象世界瞬息万变，但本质规律恒常不变​​。在资源与经济领域，这一思想启示我们：\n• ​​短期​​：理解价格波动是“色”的显现，受供需、政策等条件制约；\n• ​​长期​​：坚守周期本质（空），如康波周期对资产配置的指引，方能实现财富积累。\n简单理解就是财富=政策（大宗商品.资源交易）+周期！", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 900802853, "name": "家有垂耳兔", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0018-eVxPJg8_ZdR5Gy5EmFnB110/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "家有垂耳兔", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240923-25", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "狂暴阅读周", "levelIndex": 25}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "465-535", "createTime": 1767887134, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "900802853_860DWZMKa", "userVid": 900802853, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1767887479, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 13, "likes": [{"userVid": 915806723, "name": "礼遇未来", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/FTPv97kVqP2CXwnsCtrIicPic4CxG6sW5JotETMMTblAhtiauUyAgfrm2zcel8a7JNJopoGc6L8y2ia0HwrwibQ3IEXcbRjbh2Q2v6agssmlRzeI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVT